#. y1:english="Well,||how about warming me up, little bitch!\nWho are you?!\nYou're Chisa, aren't you?\nYou know Azusa Mizuguchi, right?||She's your friend, right?\nSo what?\nWell, Azusa disappeared without paying off||her debt.\nSo, why don't you come with us for a bit...\nWhat are you saying?||It's none of my business!\nHey, man. Chisa's kinda busy today.||If you wanna have fun, find another girl.\nKazuma-san...\nI understand that you wanna be||the big hero in front of the girl.\nBut you better choose your opponents wisely||or you might end up getting hurt.\nI'll teach you a lesson you'll never forget!\n\nI'm sorry, Kazuma-san... I'm sorry for||making you feel uncomfortable...\nHehe... So leave Chisa to us.||I promise we won't bite... too hard..."
